		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f2bc81a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="f2bc81a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-051d04b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="051d04b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-da70468 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="da70468" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-85b5b92 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="85b5b92" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">FAQs 
</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0043566 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="0043566" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d8caf38 elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion" data-id="d8caf38" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;expanded&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}" data-widget_type="nested-accordion.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="e-n-accordion" aria-label="Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys">
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2270" class="e-n-accordion-item" open>
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="1" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2270" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> 1. Which pilot spray gun should I use to spray a car? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2270" class="elementor-element elementor-element-b7174b4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="b7174b4" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2b49546 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2b49546" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For automotive painting, go with a high‑precision HVLP or professional series like Pilot’s Evolution or Legacy range. These give fine atomization, smooth coverage, and consistent finishes ideal for base coats and top coats on cars. </span></p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2271" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="2" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2271" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> 2. How do I clean a spray paint gun after spraying? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2271" class="elementor-element elementor-element-a3874ff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="a3874ff" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-256c40e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="256c40e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Clean your spray gun right after use to prevent build‑up. Empty any leftover paint, disassemble key parts like the nozzle, air cap, and needle, then rinse and brush them with the appropriate solvent. Dry thoroughly before putting everything back together. </span></p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2272" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="3" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2272" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> 3. What paint/coatings can I use with the Pilot Spray Gun? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2272" class="elementor-element elementor-element-e615283 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e615283" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c04c80c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c04c80c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Pilot Spray Gun works with a wide range of coatings, stains, primers, topcoats, and many automotive paints. </span></p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2273" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="4" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2273" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> 4. How long does each nozzle last? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2273" class="elementor-element elementor-element-9cd5554 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="9cd5554" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4742511 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4742511" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">On the Pilot Spray Gun, each nozzle typically lasts about 150–200 hours of refinishing work. That usually equals roughly 15–20 average jobs, though actual life depends on use and materials.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-eeaaacc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="eeaaacc" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ca9df5a elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="ca9df5a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<p>After hours of meticulous work with spray guns, your mind deserves a break. A controlled adrenaline rush can be the perfect way to unwind, and <a href="https://wazamba-pl.sobre-japon.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">wazamba-pl.sobre-japon.com</a> provides a secure environment for just that. With instant withdrawals and fair gameplay, it’s a trusted space to recharge without compromising safety.</p>  
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		
		</div>
	</div>
